        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_190516"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any glycerophosphoinositol having one phosphatidyl group esterified to one of the hydroxy groups of inositol.</obo:IAO_0000115>
