        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64709"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tricarboxylic acid that is propan-1-ol with a hydrogen at each of the 3 carbon positions replaced by a carboxy group.</obo:IAO_0000115>
