        <obo:IAO_0000115>Hemicelluloses are polysaccharides in plant cell walls that have beta-(1-&gt;4)-linked backbones with an equatorial configuration. Hemicelluloses include xyloglucans, xylans, mannans and glucomannans, and beta-(1-&gt;3,1-&gt;4)-glucans.</obo:IAO_0000115>
