        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_22315"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A glycoalkaloid poison found in species of the nightshade family (Solanaceae), such as the potato (Solanum tuberosum). It is a trisccharide derivative of solanidine [(22beta)-solanid-5-en-3beta-ol].</obo:IAO_0000115>
