        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_26873"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A triterpenoid saponin that is composed of soyasapogenol B having an alpha-L-rhamnopyranosyl-(1-&gt;2)-beta-D-galactopyranosyl-(1-&gt;2)-beta-D-glucopyranosiduronic acid moiety attached at the 3-position via a glycosidic linkage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
