        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_166895"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A biflavonoid that is obtained by coupling of two molecules of (-)-epigallocatechin 3-gallate resulting in a bond between positions C-2 of the hydroxyphenyl ring. It is a natural product found in oolong tea.</obo:IAO_0000115>
